{"id":"n61440-2-8","stage":5,"title":"동력 · 动力","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61440-2-8-1","ko":"저는 힘들 때 아이의 사진을 보며 기운을 내요.","zh":"我难过的时候，就会看看孩子的照片来打气。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들","meaning":"艰难，困难","explanation":"힘들다：艰难，困难；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"4","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들","audio":"/audio/00855e55295b70cc2d1d.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"아이의","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이의","audio":"/audio/1fbb843c67be8ce34ca7.mp3"}},{"text":"사진을","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사진을","audio":"/audio/3394e235d3ed53a58eaf.mp3"}},{"text":"보며","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；며：表示同时进行或并列；与 도 合用可表示“同时却、尽管”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origi