":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"振作、鼓起干劲（힘/기운을 내다）","pronunciation":["내ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d8890be6dc17b4968490.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61440-2-8-2","ko":"저도요, 우리 아이가 제 인생의 동력이에요.","zh":"我也是，我们的孩子是我人生的动力。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저도요,","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；도：表示“也、连……也”；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저도요","audio":"/audio/44b13700afadcf153a4b.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"아이가","meaning":"孩子","explanation":"아이：孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"2","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이가","audio":"/audio/820c647554b7d3f4fc3a.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"인생의","meaning":"人生","explanation":"인생：人生；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"인생","audio":"/audio/f5266ca313518a9f06d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62449","senseId":"1","lemma":"인생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"인생의","audio":"/audio/d5bacfdec3c0e0ab3544.mp3"}},{"text":"동력이에요.","meaning":"动力，推动力","explanation":"동력：动力，推动力；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"동력","audio":"/audio/49374a1407527b75ebe4.mp3